    (euclideanConnection (F := Plane)).curvatureFormAt
      (DCEuclideanMetric (F := Plane)) p x y z t = 0 := by
  rw [AffineConnection.curvatureFormAt]
  rw [euclidean_curvatureOperatorAt_eq_zero]
  simp
```

